[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] # Web Template
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] This template is a single-port web application. The frontend is built with Vite and React, and the backend is an Express server that serves both `/api/*` routes and the compiled frontend from `frontend/dist`.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ## Project Layout
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `frontend/`: React, Vite, Tailwind, Vitest, and frontend tests.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `backend/`: Express, SQLite runtime helpers, backend Vitest tests, and Playwright E2E tests.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `backend/src/app.js`: Express app, `/api/health`, static frontend hosting, and SPA fallback.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `backend/src/index.js`: Backend process entrypoint.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ## Prerequisites
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - Node.js and npm.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - A shell environment that can install npm dependencies in both `frontend` and `backend`.
[2026-09-26T13:15:19.212+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
