[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] npm install
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] cd ../frontend
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] npm install
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ```
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ## Build and Run
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] The production-style runtime is backend-led. Build the frontend first, then start the backend:
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ```bash
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] cd frontend
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] npm run build
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] cd ../backend
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] npm run start
[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ```
