[2026-09-26T13:25:10.902+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] The backend listens on `PORT` when set, otherwise it uses the template port configured by ARC. After startup, the backend serves the compiled frontend and API routes from the same origin.
